window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She wants the scoop on his scandal.</p> <p>But his shady past comes back and threatens their safety.</p> <p>Their careers, hearts and lives are on the line.</p> <p>Alissa Tuttle feeds on the thrill of uncovering celebrity secrets.</p> <p>When the spotlight lands on baseball bad boy Mick Tuttle, she's on it like a curveball. Little does she know, there's more to Mick than meets the eye and her world unravels.</p> <p>A dangerous scoop forces them into lockdown at his house. Sparks fly as Alissa sees the real Mick and the walls between them come crashing down.</p> <p>As things between them heat up, she questions everything she thought she knew about him.</p> <p>But can Alissa handle the truth about Mick and the dangers it brings?</p> <p>Will she risk her career and her life for love, or will the truth tear them apart?</p> <p>Scoring With The Enemy, a steamy romance by L.J. Grey, blends forced proximity, secrets, and sizzling chemistry into an irresistible tale. If you crave enemies-to-lovers heat and pulse-pounding suspense, dive into Mick and Alissa's fiery tale of love against the odds.</p> <p>Don't miss out - grab your copy of 'Scoring With The Enemy' now and join Mick and Alissa on a rollercoaster ride of passion, danger and redemption!</p>"; 
